    "faqs":  [
                 {
                     "question":  "What software and tools do you use for editing?",
                     "answer":  "I primarily edit using Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, and DaVinci Resolve for industry-grade color grading and audio engineering. I also use Photoshop and Blender for custom visual elements and high-CTR thumbnail designs."
                 },
                 {
                     "question":  "How do we share footage and communicate during the project?",
                     "answer":  "You can send footage through Google Drive, Dropbox, Frame.io, or WeTransfer. For day-to-day updates and communication, we can connect on Discord, WhatsApp, Slack, or X (Twitter) DM—whatever works best for your workflow."
                 },
                 {
                     "question":  "What is your typical turnaround time?",
                     "answer":  "For Short-form content (Reels, TikToks, Shorts), delivery is usually within 24 to 48 hours. For Long-form YouTube edits, turnaround is typically 3 to 5 days depending on the project complexity and depth of motion graphics required."
                 },
                 {
                     "question":  "How do revisions work?",
                     "answer":  "Every project includes revisions until you are 100% satisfied with the outcome. My priority is ensuring the final video matches your vision and achieves maximum viewer retention."
                 },
                 {
                     "question":  "Can you edit both long-form YouTube videos and short-form reels?",
                     "answer":  "Yes! I produce both retention-engineered long-form YouTube videos and high-impact vertical short-form reels engineered specifically for viral reach across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube Shorts."
                 },
                 {
                     "question":  "What are your pricing and payment options?",
                     "answer":  "I offer both per-project pricing and discounted monthly retainer packages for creators who need consistent weekly content. Payments can be handled smoothly via PayPal, Payoneer, Wise, Bank Transfer, or Crypto, or Crypto."
                 }
